    <p>Dana-Farber Cancer Institute provides expert, compassionate, and equitable care to children and adults and is home to groundbreaking cancer discoveries. Since its founding in 1948, the Jimmy Fund has raised millions of dollars through thousands of community efforts to advance Dana-Farber’s lifesaving mission.</p>
