      <p><strong>Editor</strong><br>Tarice Gray</p>
      <p><strong>Assistant Editor</strong><br>Hannah White Hannah</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-impact-page__staff-column">
      <p><strong>Creative Director</strong><br>Claudia de Piante</p>
      <p><strong>Art Directors</strong><br>Grace Howard, Sharon Veino</p>
      <p><strong>Print Production Manager</strong><br>Danielle Gray</p>
      <p><strong>Photography Manager</strong><br>Jessamyn Martin</p>
