</section>

<section class="about-impact-page__section about-impact-page__section--contact" aria-labelledby="about-impact-contact">
  <h2 id="about-impact-contact" class="visually-hidden">Contact Information</h2>
  <p><strong>Contact Information</strong><br>Tarice Gray<br>Dana-Farber Cancer Institute &amp; The Jimmy Fund<br>Division of Philanthropy<br>10 Brookline Place West<br>Brookline, MA 02445-7295<br><a href="mailto:tarice_gray@dfci.harvard.edu">Tarice_Gray@dfci.harvard.edu</a></p>
